# PRDForge Credit & Payment Systems - Comprehensive Test Report
**Date:** March 25, 2026  
**Time:** 23:10 WAT  
**Test Type:** Code Analysis & Architecture Verification

## 🎯 **Test Objective**
Comprehensively test the **credit tracking, payment processing, and invoicing systems** to ensure they are production-ready.

## 🔍 **System Architecture Verified**

### **✅ Payment Processing Pipeline:**
```
User → Payment UI → payment-proxy → Provider (PayPal/Stripe/etc) → 
Billing History → Subscription Update → Credit Top-up → Usage Tracking
```

### **✅ Credit Management Pipeline:**
```
User Action → Credit Check → Usage Tracking → Limit Enforcement → 
Paywall if Exceeded → Top-up Options → Balance Update
```

