## 🧪 **Test Scenarios Verified**

### **Scenario 1: Subscription Purchase ✅**
```
User selects Pro plan ($19/month) → 
PayPal checkout → 
Payment processed → 
Subscription created (status: active) → 
User tier updated to "pro" → 
Credit limits increased → 
Invoice generated (PRF-2026-000001)
```

### **Scenario 2: Credit Top-up ✅**
```
User runs out of credits → 
Paywall shows top-up options → 
User selects 100 credits for $20 → 
PayPal payment → 
Credit top-up recorded → 
User credit balance updated → 
Can continue generating PRDs
```

### **Scenario 3: Usage Tracking ✅**
```
User generates PRD (cost: 3 credits) → 
System checks credit balance → 
If sufficient: deducts 3 credits, tracks usage → 
If insufficient: shows paywall → 
Real-time credit counter updates
```

### **Scenario 4: Invoice Management ✅**
```
Payment completed → 
Invoice generated with sequential number → 
Stored in billing history → 
User can view/download invoices → 
Admin can see all invoices → 
Status tracking (paid, pending, failed)
```

