## 📈 **Business Logic Verified**

### **Credit Cost Calculation:**
- AI model usage has credit costs (1-5 credits)
- PRD generation has base cost (3 credits)
- Module/architecture/task generation has costs
- Credit costs configurable per AI model

### **Limit Enforcement:**
- Monthly credit reset based on subscription
- Project limits enforced per tier
- Model access restricted by tier
- Real-time checking before operations

### **Grace Periods:**
- 3-day grace period for failed payments
- Automatic retry logic
- User notifications before cancellation
- Admin configurable settings

